msgid ""
msgstr ""
"# Installation and Environment Configuration\n"
"\n"
"## 1. Overview\n"
"\n"
"This document describes how to install and configure the Triton-Ascend project environment, including the installation of the CANN toolkit, the configuration of the Ascend NPU driver and firmware, and the compilation and installation of the Triton-Ascend compiler.\n"
"\n"
"## 2. Prerequisites\n"
"\n"
"Before installing Triton-Ascend, ensure that the following conditions are met:\n"
"\n"
"- The operating system is one of the supported Linux distributions (e.g., Ubuntu 20.04/22.04, CentOS 7.6/8.2).\n"
"- The Ascend NPU hardware (e.g., Atlas A2/A3/950 series) is properly installed and recognized by the system.\n"
"- The CANN toolkit version is compatible with the Ascend NPU hardware (see the compatibility matrix for details).\n"
"- Python 3.8 or later is installed, and `pip` is available.\n"
"- CMake 3.16 or later and a C++ compiler supporting C++17 are installed.\n"
"\n"
"## 3. Installing the CANN Toolkit\n"
"\n"
"1. Download the CANN toolkit installation package from the Ascend community.\n"
"2. Install the CANN toolkit by following the official installation guide.\n"
"3. After installation, set the following environment variables:\n"
"\n"
"   ```bash\n"
"   export ASCEND_HOME=/usr/local/Ascend/ascend-toolkit/latest\n"
"   export PATH=${ASCEND_HOME}/bin:${PATH}\n"
"   export LD_LIBRARY_PATH=${ASCEND_HOME}/lib64:${LD_LIBRARY_PATH}\n"
"   ```\n"
"\n"
"## 4. Configuring the Ascend NPU Driver and Firmware\n"
"\n"
"1. Install the Ascend NPU driver and firmware packages.\n"
"2. Verify that the NPU device is recognized by the system:\n"
"\n"
"   ```bash\n"
"   npu-smi info\n"
"   ```\n"
"\n"
"   The output should list the NPU devices and their status.\n"
"\n"
"## 5. Compiling and Installing Triton-Ascend\n"
"\n"
"1. Clone the Triton-Ascend repository:\n"
"\n"
"   ```bash\n"
"   git clone https://github.com/Ascend/Triton-Ascend.git\n"
"   cd Triton-Ascend\n"
"   ```\n"
"\n"
"2. Install the Python dependencies:\n"
"\n"
"   ```bash\n"
"   pip install -r requirements.txt\n"
"   ```\n"
"\n"
"3. Compile and install the Triton-Ascend compiler:\n"
"\n"
"   ```bash\n"
"   python setup.py install\n"
"   ```\n"
"\n"
"4. Verify the installation:\n"
"\n"
"   ```bash\n"
"   python -c \"import triton; print(triton.__version__)\"\n"
"   ```\n"
"\n"
"## 6. Verifying the Environment\n"
"\n"
"Run a simple Triton kernel to verify that the environment is correctly configured:\n"
"\n"
"```python\n"
"import triton\n"
"import triton.language as tl\n"
"\n"
"@triton.jit\n"
"def add_kernel(x_ptr, y_ptr, output_ptr, n_elements, BLOCK_SIZE: tl.constexpr):\n"
"    pid = tl.program_id(axis=0)\n"
"    block_start = pid * BLOCK_SIZE\n"
"    offsets = block_start + tl.arange(0, BLOCK_SIZE)\n"
"    mask = offsets < n_elements\n"
"    x = tl.load(x_ptr + offsets, mask=mask)\n"
"    y = tl.load(y_ptr + offsets, mask=mask)\n"
"    output = x + y\n"
"    tl.store(output_ptr + offsets, output, mask=mask)\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"If the kernel executes without errors, the environment is ready for use.\n"
"\n"
"## 7. Common Issues\n"
"\n"
"### 7.1 Compilation Failure\n"
"\n"
"If the compilation fails, check the following:\n"
"\n"
"- Ensure that the CANN toolkit is correctly installed and the environment variables are set.\n"
"- Ensure that the Ascend NPU driver and firmware are correctly installed.\n"
"- Check the compiler version and ensure that it supports C++17.\n"
"\n"
"### 7.2 Runtime Errors\n"
"\n"
"If runtime errors occur, check the following:\n"
"\n"
"- Ensure that the NPU device is available and has sufficient memory.\n"
"- Check the kernel launch parameters, such as the grid size and block size.\n"
"- Use the debug environment variables (e.g., `TRITON_DEBUG=1`) to obtain detailed log output.\n"
"\n"
"## 8. Uninstalling\n"
"\n"
"To uninstall Triton-Ascend, run the following command:\n"
"\n"
"```bash\n"
"pip uninstall triton-ascend\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## 9. References\n"
"\n"
"- For more details on the CANN toolkit installation, see the [CANN Installation Guide](https://www.hiascend.com/document).\n"
"- For more details on the Ascend NPU driver and firmware, see the [Ascend NPU Driver Installation Guide](https://www.hiascend.com/document).\n"
"- For more details on Triton-Ascend, see the [Triton-Ascend Documentation](https://github.com/Ascend/Triton-Ascend).\n"

msgid "安装指南"
msgstr "Installation Guide"

msgid "**Triton-Ascend**是适配华为Ascend处理器的Triton优化版本，主要用于提供高效的核函数自动调优、算子编译及部署能力，支持Ascend Atlas A2/A3/950系列产品，兼容Triton核心语法的同时，针对昇腾NPU特性进行了深度优化，包括自动解析核函数参数、优化内存访问逻辑、完善安全部署机制等。帮助用户在昇腾平台上快速开发和部署高性能计算任务。"
msgstr "**Triton-Ascend** is an optimized version of Triton adapted for Huawei Ascend processors, primarily designed to provide efficient kernel autotuning, operator compilation, and deployment capabilities. It supports Ascend Atlas A2/A3/950 series products and, while remaining compatible with core Triton syntax, has been deeply optimized for Ascend NPU features, including automatic parsing of kernel parameters, optimized memory access logic, and enhanced secure deployment mechanisms. It helps users quickly develop and deploy high-performance computing tasks on the Ascend platform."

